abstract: >-
  Auto Populate Fields is a REDCap module that provides rich control of
  default values for data entry fields via a set of action tags. These
  action tags allow fields to be populated based on values from an ordered
  list of fields and static values. The fields can be read from the current
  event or the previous event in longitudinal projects.
